<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.steward.lists ~ who keeps which realm bag

`lares nexus realm-bags [--realm <id>]` lists the realm bags and their stewards as of the last sync, in the realm the verb names or the charter-derived realm. A listing never enters a realm.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ list

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`list` params=`~ list the charter-derived realm's bags`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ realm

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`realm` params=`takes/id ~ a cabal realm; absent, the charter-derived realm`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat-or-hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat-or-hand` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ reads this replica`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the listing failed; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ listed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`listed` params=`exit/0 ~ the bags and stewards`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares nexus realm-bags

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host door/part spells/[[lares nexus realm-bags]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

